{"segment_id": "segment_00005", "start": 150.0, "end": 180.0, "speech": "一看 escape did 提前，动词换原形。Where they're they're from? 那肯定是对 camp 提问了，对吧？没什么可说的，直接替代就行了。呃，who 对主语提问？那你注意这个地方的主语不是 the prisoner 啊，是 the prisoner of war，要连到一起的啊，不用换一般疑问句了。答案直接就是 who escaped from a camp. 第二， he killed the guard. did 提前，动词换原形。Who？你可以对 he，也可以对 the guard。注意对谁提问变一般疑问句，对谁提", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000015.webp", "time": 151.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "T: Ask me if the prisoner of war escaped", "from a camp.", "S: Did the prisoner of war escape from a", "camp?"], "scores": [0.98635, 0.96576, 0.97992, 0.98208, 0.9398], "boxes": [[[91.0, 133.0], [495.0, 137.0], [494.0, 204.0], [90.0, 199.0]], [[137.0, 274.0], [1098.0, 278.0], [1098.0, 350.0], [137.0, 345.0]], [[145.0, 343.0], [457.0, 356.0], [454.0, 413.0], [142.0, 399.0]], [[141.0, 404.0], [1095.0, 409.0], [1095.0, 476.0], [141.0, 470.0]], [[143.0, 472.0], [309.0, 472.0], [309.0, 535.0], [143.0, 535.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000016.webp", "time": 159.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.The prisoner of war escaped from a camp.", "(Where ..from) (Who)"], "scores": [0.98634, 0.99358, 0.94186], "boxes": [[[91.0, 133.0], [496.0, 137.0], [495.0, 204.0], [90.0, 199.0]], [[143.0, 276.0], [1169.0, 282.0], [1169.0, 348.0], [143.0, 341.0]], [[142.0, 339.0], [662.0, 342.0], [662.0, 404.0], [142.0, 402.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000017.webp", "time": 165.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1.The prisoner of war escaped from a camp.", "(Where ..from) (Who)"], "scores": [0.97938, 0.99063, 0.9152], "boxes": [[[90.0, 133.0], [495.0, 137.0], [494.0, 204.0], [89.0, 199.0]], [[142.0, 276.0], [1169.0, 282.0], [1169.0, 348.0], [142.0, 341.0]], [[142.0, 339.0], [661.0, 342.0], [661.0, 404.0], [142.0, 402.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
